@startuml selma_architecture_certification
' ============================================================
' Selma — Architectural Certification State Machine
' Source:  SPECIFICATION.md §9.9 (AA-01 … AA-07)
'          User_Stories.md S-30
' C4:      Architectural Auditor → Snapshots Adapter → artifact_store
'          trigger: CI/CD → Application Service
' Contract: 8.2.4
'
' Production-grade reference certification requires all AA gates.
' Document suite conformance alone does not certify an engine.
' Ownership / retention: README.md
' ============================================================

title Selma — Architectural Certification FSM\n<size:12><i>CI/CD seven-gate audit · pass/fail evidence · no runtime policy contamination</i></size>

!include ./common/sm_styles.puml

[*] --> Triggered : <b>CI/CD trigger</b>\nactor: System (CI/CD)\ncommand: start certification run\naction: cicd → application_service → architectural_auditor\nevent: CertificationTriggered

state "Triggered" as Triggered #B9770E : **entry** certification run_id assigned\n**allowed** collect evidence\n**forbidden** skip gates
state "Collecting\nEvidence" as CollectingEvidence #1B7A6E : **entry** load CG-IR samples\nevent stream excerpts\ncompiler assertion output\nsource path inventory\n**forbidden** mutate domain FSMs
state "Validating\nGates" as ValidatingGates #1B7A6E : **entry** sequential AA-01..AA-07\n**allowed** ordered gate execution\n**forbidden** partial certify
state "AA-01\nMediated Feedback" as AA01 #1B7A6E : **entry** analytics has no write path\nto CG-IR / Finding FSM\nmethod: integration (no finding→compile)
state "AA-02\nDeclarative Governance" as AA02 #1B7A6E : **entry** policy_doctrine.yaml absent\nfrom runtime paths\nmethod: static analysis + path assert
state "AA-03\nEvaluator Purity" as AA03 #1B7A6E : **entry** no IO / randomness / env\nmethod: AST / sandbox purity
state "AA-04\nSegregation of Duties" as AA04 #1B7A6E : **entry** waive + approve SoD tests\nmethod: integration SoD corpus
state "AA-05\nConflict Determinism" as AA05 #1B7A6E : **entry** byte-identical replay\nmethod: conflict replay corpus
state "AA-06\nDiscriminator Completeness" as AA06 #1B7A6E : **entry** invalid type/config corpus\nmethod: discriminator rejection set
state "AA-07\nPortable Serialization" as AA07 #1B7A6E : **entry** RE2 canaries · UTC/NaN\nmethod: portability canaries
state "Passed" as Passed #2C6E49 : **entry** all gates green\n**allowed** seal certification artifact\n**forbidden** mutate Directive Graph
state "Failed" as Failed #A93226 : **entry** one or more gates red\n**allowed** write fail evidence\n**forbidden** certify
state "Rejected" as Rejected #A93226 : **entry** evidence incomplete\nor non-reproducible run\n**allowed** remediate then re-run\n**forbidden** certify
state "Certified" as Certified #2C6E49 : **entry** certification artifact sealed\n**allowed** archive · audit_platform replica\n**forbidden** alter gate report
state "Remediation\nRequired" as RemediationRequired #B9770E : **entry** engineering fixes needed\n**allowed** new commit / rebuild\n**forbidden** mutate CG-IR · Finding FSM · Directive Graph
state "Archived" as Archived #4A4A4A : **entry** immutable retention **terminal**\n**allowed** read-only audit\n**forbidden** rewrite

Triggered --> CollectingEvidence : <b>begin collect</b>\nactor: System (Architectural Auditor)\nevent: CertificationEvidenceCollecting
CollectingEvidence --> ValidatingGates : <b>corpus complete</b>\nactor: System\nevent: CertificationEvidenceReady
CollectingEvidence --> Rejected : <b>missing evidence</b>\nactor: System\nevent: CertificationRejected\naction: incomplete corpus

ValidatingGates --> AA01 : <b>start AA-01</b>\nactor: System\nevent: CertificationGateStarted\naction: gate=AA-01
AA01 --> AA02 : <b>PASS</b>\nactor: System\nevent: CertificationGatePassed\naction: gate=AA-01
AA01 --> Failed : <b>FAIL</b>\nactor: System\nevent: CertificationGateFailed\naction: gate=AA-01
AA02 --> AA03 : <b>PASS</b>\nactor: System\nevent: CertificationGatePassed\naction: gate=AA-02
AA02 --> Failed : <b>FAIL</b>\nactor: System\nevent: CertificationGateFailed\naction: gate=AA-02
AA03 --> AA04 : <b>PASS</b>\nactor: System\nevent: CertificationGatePassed\naction: gate=AA-03
AA03 --> Failed : <b>FAIL</b>\nactor: System\nevent: CertificationGateFailed\naction: gate=AA-03
AA04 --> AA05 : <b>PASS</b>\nactor: System\nevent: CertificationGatePassed\naction: gate=AA-04
AA04 --> Failed : <b>FAIL</b>\nactor: System\nevent: CertificationGateFailed\naction: gate=AA-04
AA05 --> AA06 : <b>PASS</b>\nactor: System\nevent: CertificationGatePassed\naction: gate=AA-05
AA05 --> Failed : <b>FAIL</b>\nactor: System\nevent: CertificationGateFailed\naction: gate=AA-05
AA06 --> AA07 : <b>PASS</b>\nactor: System\nevent: CertificationGatePassed\naction: gate=AA-06
AA06 --> Failed : <b>FAIL</b>\nactor: System\nevent: CertificationGateFailed\naction: gate=AA-06
AA07 --> Passed : <b>PASS</b>\nactor: System\nevent: CertificationGatePassed\naction: gate=AA-07
AA07 --> Failed : <b>FAIL</b>\nactor: System\nevent: CertificationGateFailed\naction: gate=AA-07

Passed --> Certified : <b>seal certification artifact</b>\nactor: System\ncommand: write-once pass evidence + gate report\nevent: CertificationSealed
Failed --> RemediationRequired : <b>write fail evidence</b>\nactor: System\ncommand: gate-id fail report\nevent: CertificationFailed\nstory: S-30
Rejected --> RemediationRequired : <b>require remediation</b>\nactor: System\nevent: CertificationRemediationRequired

Certified --> Archived : <b>archive</b>\nactor: System\ncommand: retain + async audit_platform replica\nevent: CertificationArchived
RemediationRequired --> Triggered : <b>new commit / rebuild</b>\nactor: System (CI/CD)\ncommand: new certification run_id\nevent: CertificationRetriggered
Archived --> [*] : <b>terminal</b>\nactor: System\ncommand: sink\nevent: none

@enduml
